PLAY

Begin at ◇.

Choose a neighboring fold.

Apply its operation to the active object.

The resulting object becomes the next note.

state = SEED
while playing:
    fold = choose_adjacent_operation(state)
    next = apply(fold, state)
    delta = difference(state, next)
    render(next)
    if delta contains useful novelty:
        retain(delta)
    if no useful delta:
        change_route or STOP
    state = next

